{"displayStem":"위아전절제 후 8개월 된 55세 여자가 식후 두 차례 불편을 호소한다. 당뇨병이나 혈당강하제 복용력은 없다. 표와 그래프는 동일한 식사 뒤의 가상 기록이다.","notes":[{"kind":"provenance","text":"교육용 가상 자료"}],"evidenceMarkup":["<div class=\"dataset-evidence batch-C05 c05-batch\"><div class=\"evidence c05-figure\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 620 500\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"교육용 모의 관측점 그래프\"><rect width=\"620\" height=\"500\" fill=\"white\"></rect><g font-family=\"Noto Sans CJK KR, sans-serif\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"black\"><path d=\"M78 175V390H553\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path><path d=\"M78 390v6\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"78\" y=\"422\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0</text><path d=\"M157.16666666666666 390v6\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"157.16666666666666\" y=\"422\" text-anchor=\"middle\">30</text><path d=\"M236.33333333333331 390v6\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"236.33333333333331\" y=\"422\" text-anchor=\"middle\">60</text><path d=\"M315.5 390v6\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"315.5\" y=\"422\" text-anchor=\"middle\">90</text><path d=\"M394.66666666666663 390v6\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"394.66666666666663\" y=\"422\" text-anchor=\"middle\">120</text><path d=\"M473.83333333333337 390v6\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"473.83333333333337\" y=\"422\" text-anchor=\"middle\">150</text><path d=\"M553 390v6\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"553\" y=\"422\" text-anchor=\"middle\">180</text><text x=\"67\" y=\"397\" text-anchor=\"end\">0</text><text x=\"67\" y=\"344.5\" text-anchor=\"end\">50</text><text x=\"67\" y=\"292\" text-anchor=\"end\">100</text><text x=\"67\" y=\"239.5\" text-anchor=\"end\">150</text><text x=\"67\" y=\"187\" text-anchor=\"end\">200</text><text x=\"25\" y=\"145\">혈장 포도당 (mg/dL)</text><text x=\"310\" y=\"475\" text-anchor=\"middle\">식후 시간 (min)</text><path d=\"M25 24h35\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-dasharray=\"\"></path><text x=\"70\" y=\"31\">혈당</text><polyline points=\"78,297.6 130.77777777777777,224.1 236.33333333333331,205.2 394.66666666666663,343.8 553,296.55\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-dasharray=\"\"></polyline><circle cx=\"78\" cy=\"297.6\" r=\"4\" fill=\"black\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"130.77777777777777\" cy=\"224.1\" r=\"4\" fill=\"black\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"236.33333333333331\" cy=\"205.2\" r=\"4\" fill=\"black\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"394.66666666666663\" cy=\"343.8\" r=\"4\" fill=\"black\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"553\" cy=\"296.55\" r=\"4\" fill=\"black\" stroke=\"black\"></circle></g></svg></div></div>","<div class=\"dataset-evidence batch-C05 c05-batch\"><div class=\"evidence c05-figure\"><div class=\"evidence\"><table><thead><tr><th>시각</th><th>동반 관찰</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>20분</td><td>복통·설사, 맥박 증가</td></tr><tr><td>120분</td><td>식은땀·손떨림·멍함, 경구 포도당 후 회복</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div>"]}